// Naruto (original series, episodes 1–220) — filler / canon guide.
// Source: Anime Filler List (animefillerlist.com/shows/naruto), retrieved 2026-11-12.
// Cross-checked against the Naruto Fandom wiki (naruto.fandom.com): see README.md.
// arc: story arc from each episode's Naruto Fandom wiki page ("Standalone" = no arc listed).
// chapters: manga chapters the episode adapts, from the same pages (absent for anime-only episodes).
// desc: a short, spoiler-light summary of the episode's setup, written for this app (from the Naruto Fandom wiki synopses).
